{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/extras/52eb7afb8d78ddb4183dd8ceaea0bf12.poster.avif?t=1772951031\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/extras/52eb7afb8d78ddb4183dd8ceaea0bf12.webm?t=1772951031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/extras/52eb7afb8d78ddb4183dd8ceaea0bf12.mp4?t=1772951031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual Hunting and Gathering</strong><br> <br>Hunt exotic creatures on alien planets and gather rare ingredients. Upgrade your gear with cantina profits to prepare for new hunts. <br>   <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/extras/7e03ef3fd89ebbf01b84f9f9f675b036.poster.avif?t=1772951031\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/extras/7e03ef3fd89ebbf01b84f9f9f675b036.webm?t=1772951031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/extras/7e03ef3fd89ebbf01b84f9f9f675b036.mp4?t=1772951031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night-Time Cantina Management and Mini-Game Showdowns</strong><br><br>Cook and serve your ingredients to cosmic customers by night.    <br>     <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/extras/ea06f93247da96dafe571c1cdda30d50.poster.avif?t=1772951031\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/extras/ea06f93247da96dafe571c1cdda30d50.webm?t=1772951031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/extras/ea06f93247da96dafe571c1cdda30d50.mp4?t=1772951031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve the Galaxy's Pickiest Eaters</strong><br><br>Summon the legendary Gastronauts\u2014colossal wandering food critics\u2014and engage in chaotic mini-game challenges to satisfy their impossible cravings and build your cantina's fame.<strong> </strong>  <br>   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful Pixel Art Universe with Quirky Characters\u00a0</strong><br>Explore vibrant alien planets filled with eccentric species and bizarre environments.  <br>Meet lovable misfits who visit your cantina, each with their own humorous stories and in-jokes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plenty of Additional Content\u00a0</strong><br>Discover side quests, hidden recipes, and special events across the galaxy.  <br>Collect all creature types, unlock new recipes, and uncover the mysteries of the cosmos. <br> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926330?t=1772951031","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/c3b8327fbedb97f0de160d6a0693fdea18484e6e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772951031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/bc1ec0a50e0dfe329753802511252ecde8ddfca9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772951031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926330/bc1ec0a50e0dfe329753802511252ecde8ddfca9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772951031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"descr